title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/item:delete
catalog: GUI command
target: item:delete
summary: Delete what is designated: its file to the trash, or the metarecord without a file (selection / query)

!! Reference

* Defined by the shipped ``commands.js``

!! Default keys

* ``delete`` → ``item:delete`` (in the ``duplicates`` panel)
* ``delete`` → ``item:delete`` (in the ``file-manager`` panel)
* ``delete`` → ``item:delete`` (in the ``metarecord-list`` panel)
* ``delete`` → ``item:delete`` (in the ``path-ref`` panel)
* ``delete`` → ``item:delete`` (in the ``viewer`` panel)
* ``e d`` → ``item:delete``
* ``e e d`` → ``item:delete selection``
* ``e q d`` → ``item:delete query``
* ``shift+e d`` → ``item:delete selection``
